            <creation xml:id="creation_158N200CB">
               <date isodate="1865-12" xml:id="date_7dd911e4"> Christmas 1865</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_158N200C9">
               <p xml:id="idm75">The music teacher Adolph Lund mentioned in Gade's piece lived on the north side of Hauserplads in 1844. He was a co-founder of Musikforeningen, and in 1844 he and Hartmann had been advisers in a case concerning the restauration of the organ in Reformert Kirke in Gothersgade in Copenhagen.</p>
            </history>
